[b]Finally the second and final part of the awesome update!
Shields will be added to your tower![/b]

[h2]Changelog[/h2]

[list]
[*] A new shield Mechanic will be added to the game;
[*] Threats will now first hit the shield before destroying a room (given that the shield is protecting said room);
[*] Shields can be moved between floors;
[*] Shields can be destroyed/repaired;
[*] Shield can be upgraded (more than once);
[*] Added a ForgeMancer upgrade for the shield;
[*] Added a JailMancer upgrade for the shield;
[*] Added a Shield/Jail interaction;
[*] Added a Alchemancer upgrade for the shield;
[*] Added a CookMancer upgrade for the shield;
[*] Added a Shield/Rooms repair interaction;
[*] Added a new sibling, the ShieldMancer;
[*] Changed the tutorial, so it explains the shield mechanics;
[*] Changed dialogs to include the shield and ShieldMancer;
[*] Added each shield to the grimoire, with the respective information;
[*] Added a highlight to the defense rooms button (TAB);
[*] Included a Steam/Discord links within the game;
[/list]

We look forward to hearing what you think of the changes.
If you have any suggestions, join our Discord:

https://discord.gg/gQnDNccHBy

[url=https://discord.gg/gQnDNccHBy][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39173704/db854e22fe0785902f2ca69ce793c1db39d1c252.png[/img][/url]

[b]You asked for news and TowerMancer listened!
Our new update lets you defend yourself from Rogue attacks! [/b]

[h3]Changelog[/h3]

[list]
[*] Changed the rogue so it can be stopped by an imp. Now it takes a few seconds for the resources to be stolen;
[*] Changed the mage so she can be stopped by the imp. Now it takes a few seconds for the room to be sent back in time;
[*] Added a progress bar for rogue and mage action;
[*] Imps can now defend against rogues and mages. When any of these threats enter a room, the Imp can be dragged into the fight and kick them out of the tower;
[*] Added a tutorial on how to fight rogues and mages;
[*] Changed the prison to lock up a rogue or a mage that is defeated by an imp;
[*] Added fighting visual effects.
[*] A warning flag appears to alert the player when a room is under attack (Being robbed or going back in time);
[*] On the map screen, when a room is upgraded, we add a link to the library in the "upgrade banner";
[*] Removed a bug where the prison, when destroyed, kept the prisoner.
[/list]


We look forward to hearing what you think of the changes.
If you have any suggestions, join our Discord:

